"""
doodlebook-popover — instant independent Quick Settings / Notification Center
popovers for Waybar (or any launcher).

The heavy QML engine and both windows are created once by a small resident
daemon. A button click only sends a single line over a Unix socket, so toggling
a popover is effectively instant (no `plasmawindowed` startup cost).

Usage:
    doodlebook-popover                     # run the daemon (foreground)
    doodlebook-popover daemon              # same
    doodlebook-popover toggle quicksettings
    doodlebook-popover toggle notifications
    doodlebook-popover show|hide [quicksettings|notifications]
    doodlebook-popover hide
    doodlebook-popover status notifications   # Waybar JSON
    doodlebook-popover quit
"""

